40	    /// The annotation is defined as part of a complex string literal, such as
41	    /// a literal containing an implicit concatenation or escaped characters,
42	    /// e.g. `x: "List" "[int]" = []`. These are comparatively rare, but valid.
43	    Complex,
44	}
